<apex:page standardcontroller="Quote" showheader="false" renderas="pdf">

<head>
    <style>
        body {
            font-size: 12pt;
            font-family: "Times New Roman", serif;
        }
        
        p {
            margin-top: 10px;
            line-height: 20px;
            font-size: 12pt;
            font-family: "Times New Roman", serif;
        }
        
        h2 {
            font-size: 12pt;
            text-transform: capitalize;
            margin-top: 20px;
            color: #009900;
            font-family: "Times New Roman", serif !important;
        }
        
        ul {
            font-size: 12pt;
            font-family: "Times New Roman", serif;
            margin-top: 10px;   
        }
        
        table {
            border-collapse: collapse;
            border: none;
        }
        
        table h2 {
            text-transform: capitalize;
            color: #009900;
            margin-top: 0;
        }
        
        table p span {
            font-size: 12pt !important;
        }
        
        #letter {
            padding: 70px 0;
        }
        
        #addressTo {
            text-align: left;
            float: right;
            width: 40%;
        }
        
        #toTheAttention {
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        
        #placeDate {
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        
        #offerNr {
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        
        #subject {
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        
        #letterBody {
            margin-top: 30px;
            text-align: justify;
        }
        
        #letterBody p {
            margin-top: 5px;
        }
        
        .biggerBold {
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 12pt;
        }
        
        #productDesc table{
            width: 100% !important;
            margin-left: 0 !important;
            border: 1px solid #000 !important;
        }
        
        #productDesc table h2 {
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        #productDesc table td {
            padding: 0 10px;
        }
        
        #supplyConditions table {
            font-size: 14pt;
        }
        
        #supplyConditions table td {
            font-family: "Times New Roman", serif !important;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .accessoriesTable table {
            margin-top: 5px;
        }
        
        .accessoriesTable table td {
            padding: 0;
            font-family: "Times New Roman", serif;
            font-size: 12pt !important;
        }
        
        .accessoriesDesc {
            font-size: 12pt !important;
            line-height: 20px;
            text-align: left !important;
            font-family: "Times New Roman", serif;
            width: 476px !important; 
            padding: 3px !important; 
        }
        
    </style>
</head>


<div id="letter" style="page-break-after:always;">
<apex:image value="{!$Resource.LogoVici}" style="width: 300px; float: left;" />
<div id="addressTo">
<p id="offerNr" style="font-weight: bold;">
Offer n°{!Quote.quotenumber}
</p>
   
To:<br/>
<strong><apex:outputField value="{!Quote.Opportunity.Account.Name}" /></strong><br />
<apex:outputField value="{!Quote.Opportunity.Account.BillingStreet}" /><br/>
<apex:outputField value="{!Quote.Opportunity.Account.BillingPostalCode}" />-
<apex:outputField value="{!Quote.Opportunity.Account.BillingCity}" /><br />
<apex:outputField value="{!Quote.Opportunity.Account.BillingState}" /><br/>
<apex:outputField value="{!Quote.Opportunity.Account.BillingCountry}" /><br/>
</div>
<br />
<p id="toTheAttention" style="clear: both; padding-top: 50px;">
<strong>To the attention:</strong><br/>
<apex:outputField value="{!Quote.Contact.Salutation}" /><apex:outputField value="{!Quote.Contact.Firstname}" />&nbsp;<apex:outputField value="{!Quote.Contact.Lastname}" />
</p>

<p id="placeDate">
Santarcangelo di Romagna, <apex:outputField value="{!Quote.Quote_Date__c}" />
</p>


<div id="subject">
Subject: <span class="biggerBold">Technical-economic offer for the supply of an optical measuring machine &nbsp;<apex:outputField value="{!Quote.Name}" /></span>
</div>

<div id="letterBody">
<p>
Following your kind request we are pleased to send you our offer for above mentioned machine.<br />
Looking forward to receiving your reply, we remain at your disposal for any further information you should need.
</p>

</div>

<p>
Kind Regards
</p>
<p>
<strong><apex:outputField value="{!Quote.Firma__c}"/></strong><br />
<i>Sales Manager</i>
</p>
</div>


<apex:repeat value="{!Quote.QuotelineItems}" var="m" rows="1">
<div id="productDesc" align="left">
<apex:outputField value="{!m.pricebookentry.Product2.Long_Description__c}" /><br/>
<p style="width: 100%; padding: 3px; text-align: right;">TOTAL:&nbsp;<strong><apex:outputField value="{!m.UnitPrice}" /></strong></p>

</div>
</apex:repeat>

<div class="accessoriesTable" style="page-break-before:always;">
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 700px;" border="0">
<apex:repeat value="{!Quote.QuotelineItems}" var="q" first="1">
<tr>
<td style="width: 64px; padding: 3px; text-align: right;"><strong>n.&nbsp;<apex:outputField value="{!q.Quantity}" /></strong></td>
<td style="width: 94px; padding: 3px; text-align: center;"><strong><apex:outputField value="{!q.pricebookentry.Codice_Listino__c}" /></strong></td>
<td style="width: 376px; padding: 3px; text-align: left;"><apex:outputField value="{!q.pricebookentry.Product2.Name}" /></td>
<td style="width: 134px; padding: 3px; text-align: right;"><strong><apex:outputField value="{!q.UnitPrice}" /></strong></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td style="width: 64px; padding: 3px;">&nbsp;</td>
<td colspan="2" class="accessoriesDesc"><apex:outputField value="{!q.pricebookentry.Product2.Long_Description__c}" /></td>
<td style="width: 134px; padding: 3px;">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
</apex:repeat>
</table>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 700px;" border="0">
<tr>
<td colspan="2" style="padding: 30px 3px 3px; width: 440px;">
    <p style="width: 100%; font-size: 14px !important; font-style: italic;">Please note that above mentioned prices are VAT excluded.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="width: 94px; padding: 3px; text-align: right;" width="70%">SHIPPING CHARGES:</td>
<td style="width: 134px; padding: 3px; text-align: right;" width="70%"><strong><apex:outputField value="{!Quote.ShippingHandling}" /></strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="width: 94px; padding: 3px; text-align: right;" width="70%">GRAND TOTAL:</td>
<td style="width: 134px; padding: 3px; text-align: right;" width="70%"><strong><apex:outputField value="{!Quote.GrandTotal}" /></strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="width: 94px; padding: 3px; text-align: right;" width="70%">SPECIAL RESERVED PRICE FOR YOU:</td>
<td style="width: 134px; padding: 3px; text-align: right;" width="70%"><strong><apex:outputField value="{!Quote.Totale_finale_per_cliente__c}" /></strong></td>
</tr>

</table>
    
<table cellpadding="5" cellspacing="2" style="width: 700px; margin-top: 50px;" border="0">
    <tr>
        <td style="padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px !important; "><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Terms of payment:</span>&nbsp;<apex:outputField value="{!Quote.Pagamento__c}" /></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>    
        <td style="padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px !important;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Delivery date:</span>&nbsp;<apex:outputField value="{!Quote.Tempi_di_consegna__c}" /></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px !important;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Packing:</span>&nbsp;<apex:outputField value="{!Quote.Imballo__c}" /></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px;font-size: 14px !important;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Freight:</span>&nbsp;<apex:outputField value="{!Quote.ShippingHandling}" /></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px !important;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Delivery terms:</span> exworks</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px !important;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Warranty:</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px !important;">MTL Products manufactured by Vici &amp; C. Spa are subject of the warranty against defects in material and for workmanship for a period of 12 months from the date of machine installation or at latest 18 months from the date of the shipment from Vici's plant.<br />
Warranty will start from the date of receiving in Vici of the form stating that the installation performance has taken place.<br />
In order to avail this warranty, the customer must report any defects to VICI in writing within 5 days of discovery of such defects.<br />
Parts subject to normal wear and tear are not covered by the warranty as well as standard and scheduled maintenance interventions such as cleaning, settings or adjustments that the customer wishes to perform.<br />
During the period of coverage, Vici &amp; C. Spa will repair or replace the components which have been examined and declared defective. Return of the substituted materials is DAP, our warehouse in Santarcangelo di Romagna (RN). Freight of the material and travelling expenses of our technicians will be the purchaser's responsibility.<br />
The warranty provided by VICI will cease validity in all cases should the PRODUCTS be installed or handled in any way by third parties who are not authorized by VICI, and/or original spare parts are not used, and/or if the PRODUCTS are not used in accordance with the instructions provided by VICI or in all cases of tampering, overuse, improper or incidental use.<br /> 
VICI will be in charge of free replacement of faulty parts.<br /> 
The on-site warranty service is granted by the official certified Vici Vision reseller according to the law in force in the country of sale.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px !important;">
            <span style="text-decoration: underline;">Offer to be effective till:</span>&nbsp;<apex:outputField value="{!Quote.ExpirationDate}" />
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>
    
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 700px;" border="0">
    <tr>
        <td width="50%">&nbsp;</td>
        <td width="50%" style="text-align: center;">
            <p>
                <strong><apex:outputField value="{!Quote.Firma__c}"/></strong><br />
                <i>Sales Manager</i>
            </p>
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="text-align: center; padding-top: 30px;">For acceptance of purchased:</td>
        <td style="text-align: center; padding-top: 30px;">For acceptance of supplier:</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="text-align: center; padding-top: 40px;"><hr style="height: 1px; border: 0; background-color: #666; width: 80%;" /></td>
        <td style="text-align: center; padding-top: 40px;"><hr style="height: 1px; border: 0; background-color: #666; width: 80%;" /></td>
    </tr>    
</table>
</div>
</apex:page>